# @acme/money

Formats integer minor-unit amounts (cents, pence, yen…) as display strings.

```js
import { formatMoney } from '@acme/money';

formatMoney(123456, 'USD'); // '$1,234.56'
```

Supported currencies are listed in `src/currencies.js`.

## Development

